sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant L as verifyCertificate Lambda
    participant D as DynamoDB

    C->>L: GET /verifyCertificate/{id}  (no auth required)
    alt missing id
        L-->>C: 400 Bad Request
    end

    L->>D: GetItem by id
    D-->>L: item or nothing

    alt certificate found
        L-->>C: 200 OK {message, name, url}
    else certificate not found
        L-->>C: 404 Not Found
    end

    Note over L: any unhandled failure (DynamoDB) is caught<br/>and returned as 500, never left unhandled
